# What draw-maps.sh tells aider to leave out of every map (gitignore syntax, read against the clone's root).

# The lexer, parser, and listeners ANTLR generates from DirectEdit.g4, which are committed next to the
# grammar. The parser alone is thousands of lines of rule methods.
backend/services/syson-direct-edit-grammar/src/main/java/org/eclipse/syson/direct/edit/grammars/

# Third-party code bundled into single files: the SysIDE command-line tool that the import runs under
# Node to parse textual SysML (4 MB, built with esbuild), and the minified scripts of the documentation's UI.
backend/application/syson-sysml-import/src/main/resources/syside-cli.js
doc/doc-ui/src/js/vendor/

# Pictures: icons for the EMF editor and the diagrams, and the documentation's screenshots. They have
# no definitions to show.
*.gif
*.png
*.svg
